---
import { flowcastVersion, installCommand } from '../lib/version';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---
<section class="compact-install container" aria-labelledby="install-title"><div class="section-heading compact"><p class="eyebrow">CURRENT VALIDATED RELEASE · {flowcastVersion}</p><h2 id="install-title">Start broadcasting on your own infrastructure</h2><p>Install the current validated JuggleCast Community release on Linux amd64 with Docker Compose.</p></div><div class="terminal compact-terminal"><div class="terminal-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>flowcast-install</b></div><pre><code>{installCommand}</code></pre></div><p class="install-warning">Docker Engine and Docker Compose v2 must already be installed.</p><div class="inline-actions"><a class="button" href={withBase('installation')}>Read the installation guide</a><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/chourmovs/FlowCast-Community/blob/main/SECURITY.md">Review the security model</a></div></section>
